From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the shell manages every installed extension

The shell's tray menu lists every installed extension, switched on or
off, and pins, switches, configures and uninstalls them. Blink builds:

- `DomicileInstalledExtension`, one extension in
  `domicile.installedExtensions`.
- `DomicileExtensionSettings`, what `configureExtension()` sets.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_modules.gni | 4 ++++
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_modules.gni       | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

